From: Stoicoci Mihaita <stoicocimihaita@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: q706f: opt CTN730 into VEN experiment

Allow the optional out-of-tree CTN730 variant to deassert VEN in
system suspend when its runtime switch is enabled. The ordinary
driver does not consume this property.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-lenovo-q706f.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-lenovo-q706f.dts
@@ -926,6 +926,7 @@
 	pen-charger@28 {
 		compatible = "nxp,ctn730";
 		reg = <0x28>;
+		nxp,q706f-allow-suspend-ven-off;
 
 		interrupts-extended = <&tlmm 111 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 		enable-gpios = <&pm8150l_gpios 8 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
